# Source constraint for astroai-workload (cluster extra), consumed by
# `make lock-workload`. Installed into the base cadc venv (py3.13-safe:
# httpx/typer/canfar only — no Ray) so every session can run
# `astroai-workload cluster ensure|status|stop|scale|dashboard`.
#
# Unpinned on purpose: the container TAG is the user-facing version, so the
# image bakes whatever `main` is at lock time (regenerate with
# `make lock-workload` — never edit the lockfile by hand).
# NOTE: because this is unpinned, `make lock-check` re-resolves `main` HEAD,
# so lock drift is now automatic on every upstream push — CI fails with
# "lockfile drift" until `make lock-workload` + commit (expected workflow).
astroai-workload[cluster] @ git+https://github.com/astroai/astroai-workload.git
